<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 2.0 bln SKR in 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 2.0 bln SKR in 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Friday said it would invite bids on January 15 for an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of 10-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on January 15.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1038</p>
<p> Auction date			    Jan 15, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date			   Oct 25, 2006</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			   6.50</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)   2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			 Jan 20, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
